<title>FINLAND: Helsinki bourse HEX index rises 1.1 pct to life high.</title>
<headline>Helsinki bourse HEX index rises 1.1 pct to life high.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helsinki bourse HEX index on Wednesday rose 1.1 percent to all-time high 3,068.20 in fair trade.</p>
<p>The previous all-time high was 3,067.92 set on May 16.  </p>
<p>After hitting the new life-high the HEX index retreated slightly to 3,066.94, still up 1.05 percent.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50248</p>
